UPSTREAM ATTRIBUTION

This project uses the OpenFlexure Block Stage (CC BY-SA 4.0) UNMODIFIED
as its 3-axis flexure base. Our confocal optical column, stepper
actuators, electronics housing, and illumination are an extension that
bolts onto the standard block stage without modifying its parts.

  Upstream project page : https://openflexure.org/projects/blockstage/
  Upstream source       : https://gitlab.com/openflexure/openflexure-block-stage

Because we use the block stage unmodified, our extension is not strictly
a "derivative" of the stage's CAD under CC BY-SA 4.0. We nevertheless
release our extension under the same CC BY-SA 4.0 licence to keep the
open-hardware chain intact and to match the upstream licence.

When citing or redistributing the upstream design, please attribute as:

  "Confocal extension for the OpenFlexure Block Stage by the
   OpenFlexure project, (c) OpenFlexure, CC BY-SA 4.0."

